OL,5,G1500 Lynn Bowles
OL,6,     FMusic, entertainment, and great
OL,7,     Fguests for your Sunday afternoon.
OL,8,G1700 Roy Noble
OL,9,     FRoy chats with Gillian Edwards
OL,10,     Fabout her novel inspired by the
OL,11,     Fwartime experiences of her
OL,12,     Fmother-in-law. And astronomer
OL,13,     FAllan Trow previews the
OL,14,     Fforthcoming partial solar eclipse.
